OL,4,CFormer police chief inspector jailed   
OL,5,Cfor rape                               
OL,6,GA former police chief inspector who    
OL,7,Gonce worked with convicted murderer    
OL,8,GWayne Couzens has been sentenced to 10-
OL,9,Gand-a-half years in prison for two     
OL,10,Gcounts of rape and one of sexual       
OL,11,Gassault.                               
OL,13,FGlen Mahony, 54, who was convicted at  
OL,14,FMaidstone Crown Court in September     
OL,15,Ffollowing a 10-day trial, carried out  
OL,16,Ftwo attacks while his victim was       
OL,17,Fasleep.                                
